{"id":2581,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>5月20日，由我院主办的中北大学第二十一届数智化企业经营沙盘大赛在经管楼正式举行。全校共26支队伍参与比赛，由工业工程系牛慧卿担任总裁判长，郭心雨、赵胤和高芳杰担任裁判员。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iUlCD8LRliU4UaLs4AVnmlZMzlDnmnZ7L8UYnz6fnRvaLz70gihFp2hmCIa0MkyYLSyankyZMNlZMNlZo7U8Mmvanm7YUNl8L4TVnzLsMm6FMRNsU8UsolQFLl7iU8CJqjfjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRGbg47ZMzG4gtA8pUbcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1009&nid=18503&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4210D86E86E88D4670F12BE439EE3767/497CD79F/1A5CF\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iMz-DPUlVRLmNYLsmT2M8WRnRfVnRWZ2olUaM7V7nz7aL470gihFp2hmCIa0MSysLSh7UYyiLlMVUlW7oR9an7nVM4TfLRlPUNM2U8QkL7VFo7MfMzL4U4rFMRLbUllbgtXaQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzGaoSyPoRlaLYbw62b8c&oid=1280026481&tid=1009&nid=18503&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br /></p><p>本次比赛采用线上赛前练习，线下正式比赛的方式进行，参赛队伍在总裁判长和裁判员的组织协调下同时进行比赛。</p><p>在赛场上，各参赛队选手始终保持沉着冷静的心态，默契配合、协同作战，以创新思维驱动经营策略。通过这场赛事，学生们对企业经营的认知得以深度拓展，实践能力与创新能力也得到全方位锻炼。本次大赛的成功不仅为大学生学术科技创新搭建了优质平台，更致力于培养兼具扎实创新知识与卓越创新能力的综合性人才，成为助力青年学生奋发成才、实现全面发展的重要路径。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=inlWDVMzLiU4QkMs8LinmUDL8CbU8-ZsUzLsL4LbUzLYnRU0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yinkyDMkyiUNM7Ml7aU4QVnNnVU4NZol7aLmW7Lzf7UzWFn7lbLmGYMRWFLl7Pn7UJqjfjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRGbg47ZMzG4gtA8pUbcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1009&nid=18503&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B5D645BCD5A0C6EFDEC989A022D10DA2/DE920242/1A1DD\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iLmWD7M8-snNVfUsmL8LmT2oRLYozrZfU4vZozMVUz7aUmL0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hfUSyDM1hkLN-PU4-iLlCanNlsLmTRL7MVLzn7MR9Yn7WFMl-sL4N4oRQFL8rfnRC8gtXaQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzGaoSyPoRlaLYbw62b8c&oid=1280026481&tid=1009&nid=18503&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br /></p><p>中北大学第二十一届数智化企业经营沙盘大赛圆满结束，期待我校进入省赛的队伍有更出色的表现。</p><p><br /></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iUlCD8LRliU4UaLs4AVnmlZMzlDnmnZ7L8UYnz6fnRvaLz70gihFp2hmCIa0MkyYLSyankyZMNlZMNlZo7U8Mmvanm7YUNl8L4TVnzLsMm6FMRNsU8UsolQFLl7iU8CJqjfjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRGbg47ZMzG4gtA8pUbcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1009&nid=18503&e=.jpg"}